Name: cgl-rs
Short Name: cgl-rs
URL: https://github.com/servo/cgl-rs
Version: 0.3.3
Revision: d97cc08f93bfbf5b5f6520cfa0f49ac3fa01e07c
Update Mechanism: Manual (tools/import.py cgl-rs, history replayed linearly)
License: MIT / Apache-2.0
License File: N/A (see the crate manifests)
Security Critical: yes
Shipped: yes

Description:
Rust bindings for CGL on Mac

Local Modifications:
The crates (1) live in third_party/cgl-rs/<crate>, one directory per package; their manifests are rewritten by
tools/flatten.py (path dependencies, inlined workspace inheritance, one version per crate) and patched by
tools/fixups.sh and tools/patches/. Everything else of the upstream is in third_party/cgl-rs/ unchanged.

Crates:
  cgl 0.3.3 third_party/cgl-rs/cgl
